        "id": "E2",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Issue artifacts attach agent-generated outputs and other important context directly to an issue.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://github.blog/changelog/2026-10-28-issue-artifacts-are-now-in-public-preview",
        "source": "GitHub Changelog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-28T15:30:00.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-30T16:43:07.207Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E3",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "HTML files for interactive visualizations, flowcharts, and diagrams, with the ability to toggle between a rendered preview and the source.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://github.blog/changelog/2026-10-28-issue-artifacts-are-now-in-public-preview",
        "source": "GitHub Changelog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-28T15:30:00.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-30T16:43:07.207Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E4",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "When you use the GitHub App to work on an issue, artifacts created during the session are automatically attached to that issue.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://github.blog/changelog/2026-10-28-issue-artifacts-are-now-in-public-preview",
        "source": "GitHub Changelog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-28T15:30:00.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-30T16:43:07.207Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E5",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "You can also prompt the session to create a specific artifact, such as an implementation plan, root cause analysis, or summary of historical context.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://github.blog/changelog/2026-10-28-issue-artifacts-are-now-in-public-preview",
        "source": "GitHub Changelog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-28T15:30:00.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-30T16:43:07.207Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E6",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Support for creating and viewing HTML artifacts in the GitHub App is coming soon.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://github.blog/changelog/2026-10-28-issue-artifacts-are-now-in-public-preview",
        "source": "GitHub Changelog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-28T15:30:00.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-30T16:43:07.207Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E7",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "The new gh issue artifact command brings issue artifact support to GitHub CLI.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://github.blog/changelog/2026-10-28-issue-artifacts-are-now-in-public-preview",
        "source": "GitHub Changelog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-28T15:30:00.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-30T16:43:07.207Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E8",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "You can use the create , edit , list , view , download , and delete commands to manage issue artifacts.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://github.blog/changelog/2026-10-28-issue-artifacts-are-now-in-public-preview",
        "source": "GitHub Changelog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-28T15:30:00.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-30T16:43:07.207Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E9",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Artifacts can also be addressed by their GitHub URLs, and Markdown documents support image and video attachments with --attach .",
        "sourceUrl": "https://github.blog/changelog/2026-10-28-issue-artifacts-are-now-in-public-preview",
        "source": "GitHub Changelog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-28T15:30:00.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-30T16:43:07.207Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E10",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "For usage details, see the gh issue artifact documentation .",
        "sourceUrl": "https://github.blog/changelog/2026-10-28-issue-artifacts-are-now-in-public-preview",
        "source": "GitHub Changelog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-28T15:30:00.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-30T16:43:07.207Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E11",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Create, edit, and delete artifacts directly from an issue on github.com.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://github.blog/changelog/2026-10-28-issue-artifacts-are-now-in-public-preview",
        "source": "GitHub Changelog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-28T15:30:00.000Z",
